---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy · OpenHearth"
  description="Where your data lives when you use OpenHearth apps."
>

<article class="privacy-page">
  <header class="policy-header reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-stag d1 reveal">OpenHearth</p>
      <h1 class="d2 reveal">Where your data lives</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="policy-body">
    <div class="container prose">

      <p class="lead reveal">
        OpenHearth apps keep what you put in them on your own device: in the
        phone&rsquo;s app storage, or in your browser&rsquo;s storage when you use
        an app on the web. There are no accounts, no ads and no tracking. We never
        receive your data.
      </p>

      <p class="reveal">
        Something leaves your device only when you use a feature that needs it:
      </p>
      <ul class="reveal">
        <li><strong>A backup or an export:</strong> the file goes where you send it.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Sync between your own devices, and Porch with close friends:</strong>
          it is encrypted on your device first, so the relay that passes it on
          can&rsquo;t read it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Weather in WeatherGlass:</strong> the place you choose is sent to
          the weather service to get its forecast.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Looking up a barcode:</strong> the code is sent to a product
          database.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>AI features, in the apps that have them:</strong> most run on
          your device, after the app downloads what it needs. If you type in your
          own key (a password-like code) from an online AI company, your question
          goes to that company.
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </section>
</article>

</Base>

<style>
  /* ── Layout ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .privacy-page {
    padding-top: 80px; /* clear fixed nav */
  }

  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* ── Policy header ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .policy-header {
    padding: 56px 0 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-stag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .policy-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .effective-date {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-ter);
  }

  /* ── Prose body ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .policy-body {
    padding: 48px 0 96px;
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 48px 0 16px;
    padding-top: 8px;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    padding-left: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .prose li {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .prose a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }

  /* ── Three-tier architecture table ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .tier-table {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin: 24px 0 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--oh-r-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .tier-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .tier-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .tier-sync {
    background: var(--bg-tinted);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .tier-name {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-right: 24px;
  }

  .tier-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .tier-sync .tier-badge {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg-card);
  }

  body[data-theme='dark'] .tier-sync .tier-badge {
    color: var(--oh-dark-base);
  }

  .tier-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-ter);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  .tier-row ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .tier-row li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  /* ── Architecture callout quote ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .arch-quote {
    margin: 32px 0;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-tinted);
    border-radius: 0 var(--oh-r-lg) var(--oh-r-lg) 0;
  }

  .arch-quote p {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Code block ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .code-block {
    background: var(--bg-tinted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--oh-r-md);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 8px 0 16px;
  }

  .code-block code {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: inherit;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  /* ── TODO placeholder ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .todo-placeholder {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--oh-amber-400);
    background: var(--oh-amber-100);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--oh-r-sm);
  }

  body[data-theme='dark'] .todo-placeholder {
    background: rgba(196, 154, 60, 0.15);
    color: var(--oh-amber-400);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .tier-row {
      grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .privacy-page {
      padding-top: 72px;
    }
    .policy-header {
      padding: 40px 0 24px;
    }
    .tier-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .tier-name {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      padding-right: 0;
    }
    .prose h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 36px 0 12px;
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  /* ── Reduced motion ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .reveal {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
